# What does NOT go in the .vsix.
#
# Everything here is either a build input or a development dependency, and
# the package is something people download over a connection they did not
# choose. What ships is the bundled host, the webview build, and the two
# icons.

src/**
node_modules/**
tsconfig.json
.vscodeignore
bun.lock

# esbuild bundles the host into dist/extension.js, so the map would be the
# only thing in the package nobody can act on.
dist/**/*.map

# A previous package, left in the directory by `vsce package`. Without this
# every release carries the one before it, and the file doubles each time.
*.vsix
